@startuml
!include <archimate/Archimate>

title ArchiMate MCP Server - Motivation View

' Description: Stakeholders, drivers, goals and requirements for the ArchiMate MCP Server

top to bottom direction

' Elements
Motivation_Stakeholder(ai_developer, "AI Developer")
Motivation_Stakeholder(enterprise_architect, "Enterprise Architect")
Motivation_Stakeholder(claude_user, "Claude Desktop User")
